---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const COHORT_1_URL = "https://www.flowtopia.io/c/events/introduction-to-value-stream-mapping";
const COHORT_2_URL = "https://www.flowtopia.io/c/events/introduction-to-value-stream-mapping-46f1c6-fc25e183-e679-48bf-bf9d-10541f21b55b";
const CALENDLY_URL = "https://calendly.com/migueldiaseu/30min";
---

<Layout title="Introduction to Value Stream Mapping for Leaders - Miguel Dias">
  <main class="pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:underline font-medium mb-8 inline-block">← Home</a>

      <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium mb-2">1h30 training</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Introduction to Value Stream Mapping for Leaders</h1>
        <img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg object-cover aspect-[16/9] mt-6" />
      </header>

      <!-- What You'll Learn (verbatim from PDF) -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">What You'll Learn</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">After twelve workshops across Lisbon, London, Berlin, and online, I'm running a training session on the basics of VSM for engineering and product leaders who want to help their teams deliver software faster with higher quality.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">In this hands-on 1h30 workshop, you'll map and measure a delivery workflow, identify bottlenecks, and apply lean principles to improve your delivery's speed and quality.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">This 1h30 session compresses 10+ hours of mapping exercises (in a full VSM workshop) and 2 years of mapping experience to give you an overview of VSM through practical exercises.</p>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[rgb(67,97,238)] pl-4 py-2 my-6 text-gray-700 italic">"VSM drives team performance. Teams that consistently review and improve their value stream report markedly higher performance."<br /><span class="text-sm not-italic text-gray-500">— <a href="/blog/2026-02-18-dora-2025-favourite-quotes" class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:underline">State of AI-assisted Software Development 2025 by DORA, Google Cloud</a></span></blockquote>
      </section>

      <!-- Workshop Agenda -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Workshop Agenda</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Arrival and Introductions (5 min)</li>
          <li>Quick Introduction to Value Stream Mapping (5 min)</li>
          <li>Hands-on Mapping Exercise (30 min)</li>
          <li>Group Discussion on Constraints & Solutions (15 min)</li>
          <li>Action Planning & Next Steps (5 min)</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Workshop Agreement -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Workshop Agreement</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Speak up, think big, raise concerns & questions</li>
          <li>Dive in!! Add to the board</li>
          <li>Don't talk about invisible things: write it on the board, then talk about it</li>
          <li>Please be present on video and audio</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Schedule -->
      <section id="schedule" class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Schedule</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Online workshop. Public sessions below (GMT). Private training: your choice of date and time.</p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <a
            href={COHORT_1_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-workshop-register="intro"
            data-track-workshop-register="intro"
            class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md sm:p-5"
          >
            <div class="flex h-16 w-14 flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] text-center">
              <span class="text-2xl font-bold leading-none text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">5</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-600">Mar</span>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Thursday, Mar 5</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">04:00 PM – 05:30 PM GMT</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold text-red-600">Sold out</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-gray-400 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
              Sold out
            </span>
          </a>
          <a
            href={COHORT_2_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-workshop-register="intro-cohort-2"
            data-track-workshop-register="intro-cohort-2"
            class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md sm:p-5"
          >
            <div class="flex h-16 w-14 flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] text-center">
              <span class="text-2xl font-bold leading-none text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">18</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-600">Mar</span>
            </div>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Tuesday, Mar 18</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">04:00 PM – 05:30 PM GMT</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">2 spots left</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90">
              Register →
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Pricing -->
      <section class="mb-12" data-pricing="intro">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Pricing</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <a href="#schedule" class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6 block transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-3">Public (Open seats)</h3>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-1">&euro;50 per person</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">1h30</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Seats limited (10)</p>
          </a>
          <a href={CALENDLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-book-call="workshops-intro-private-pricing" class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6 block transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Private (For teams)</h3>
            <div class="flex gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="flex-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2.5 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-0.5">Online</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">&euro;2,000</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2.5 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-0.5">In person</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">&euro;3,000</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">90&ndash;120 min</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Up to 20 participants</p>
          </a>
        </div>
        <a
          href={CALENDLY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-private-training-cta="intro"
          data-track-book-call="workshops-intro-private"
          class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6 transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Want this inside your company?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Private delivery is tailored to your value stream.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90">
            Book a Call →
          </span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Photos from Previous Workshops -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Photos from Previous Workshops</h2>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/migueldiaseu_workshop-feedback-that-made-my-day-this-activity-7341374248667508736-j2aB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block hover:bg-gray-50 rounded-lg transition-colors">
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[rgb(67,97,238)] pl-4 py-2 my-4 text-gray-700 italic">"Loved the focus on practical, live applications over theory" &mdash; "I'm very excited to start playing around with actually just doing it"<br /><span class="text-sm not-italic text-gray-500">&mdash; Joost Baars, Senior Agile coach at Booking.com</span></blockquote>
        </a>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3" aria-label="Workshop photos">
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image1.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image2.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image4.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image5.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image6.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
